hadiths[300]{hadithnumber,text}:
"309","[AI-translation] Islam paak hai, to paak raho, kyunke jannat mein sirf paak dakhil hoga."
"310","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah Azza wa Jalla ke han momin ki izzat us ke kapdon ki safai mein hai."
"311","[AI-translation] Islam safai par qayam hai."
"312","[AI-translation] Gadhe aur [jin janwaron ka] gosht khaya jata hai un ke peshab mein koi harj nahin."
"313","[AI-translation] Zameen ki taharat us ka khushk ho jana hai."
"314","[AI-translation] Do pani ghusl-e-janabat ke liye kafi nahin: samandar ka pani aur hammam ka pani."
"315","[AI-translation] Jab pani chalis kulle ho jae to woh gandagi ko qabool nahin karta."
"316","[AI-translation] Zameen peshab se napak nahin hoti siwae chalis din ke baad."
"317","[AI-translation] Us [peshab] ki jagah khod do phir us par pani bahao."
"318","[AI-translation] Beshak tehband ke baghair hammam mein dakhil hona haraam qaraar diya gaya hai."
"319","[AI-translation] Agar billi bartan mein munh dale to use saat martaba dhoya jae."
"320","[AI-translation] Khade ho kar peshab na karo."
"321","[AI-translation] Jab tum mein se koi pani na pae aur nabeez pae to woh us se wuzu kare."
"322","[AI-translation] Us bait-ul-khala mein wuzu na karo jis mein tum peshab karte ho, kyunke momin ke wuzu ka pani us ki nekiyon ke sath taula jaega."
"323","[AI-translation] Jo Yahudi ya Isai se musafaha kare woh wuzu kare aur apna hath dhoe."
"324","[AI-translation] Wuzu par wuzu noor par noor hai."
"325","[AI-translation] Jo ba-wuzu hote hue wuzu kare to Allah us ke liye das nekiyan likh deta hai."
"326","[AI-translation] Jo apne bhai ko wuzu ke liye lota de goya us ne use ghoda diya."
"327","[AI-translation] Wuzu namaz ki kunji hai."
"328","[AI-translation] Miswak aadmi ki fasaahat badhati hai."
"329","[AI-translation] Miswak ke sath namaz baghair miswak ke sattar namazon se afzal hai."
"330","[AI-translation] Jo apne wuzu mein Allah ka naam le to do farishte musalsal us ke liye nekiyan likhte hain yahan tak ke us ka wuzu toot jae."
"331","[AI-translation] Apni unglion ka khilal karo taake qayamat ke din aag un ka khilal na kare."
"332","[AI-translation] Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab wuzu farmate apni angoothi hilate the."
"333","[AI-translation] Kulli aur naak mein pani dalna sunnat hai."
"334","[AI-translation] Jo sar ke masah ko bhool jae aur namaz mein yaad aae, aur use apni dadhi mein tari mile to us se le kar apne sar ka masah kare; yeh use kafi hoga. Phir agar tari na mile to woh namaz aur wuzu dohraye."
"335","[AI-translation] [Ek taweel hadees mein hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne] apni gardan ka masah kiya."
"336","[AI-translation] Gardan ka masah qayamat ke din tauq [ke azab] se aman hai."
"337","[AI-translation] Jab Aap ne dono hath dhoe to farmaya bismillah wal-hamdulillah ... jab Aap ne chehra dhoya to farmaya Allahumma bayyiz wajhi [Aey Allah mera chehra safed farma]."
"338","[AI-translation] Peshab se ek martaba, pakhane se do martaba, aur janabat se teen teen martaba [wuzu ke a'za dhoye jaen]."
"339","[AI-translation] Main apne donon paon kaat dun yeh mujhe mouzon par masah se ziyada pasand hai."
"340","[AI-translation] Mouze ke upar unglion se lakeeren kheench kar masah karo."
"341","[AI-translation] [Kisi ne poocha: Ya Rasulullah!] Kya main mouzon par masah karun? Aap ne farmaya: Han. Us ne kaha: Ek din aur do din yahan tak ke saat [din] kahe; to Aap ne us se farmaya: Jab tak tum chaho."
"342","[AI-translation] Woh [zakhm ki] pattion par masah farmate the."
"343","[AI-translation] Jab tum wuzu karo to [kapde ke neeche] pani chhidko."
"344","[AI-translation] Phir us ne achchi tarah wuzu kiya phir apni nazar aasman ki taraf uthai."
"345","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ek kapda tha jis se woh wuzu ke baad a'za ponchte the."
"346","[AI-translation] Jise [namaz mein] qai ya nakseer ya qalas ya mazi aae woh wapas jae aur wuzu kare."
"347","[AI-translation] Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qai farmai aur wuzu na kiya."
"348","[AI-translation] Jo but ko chhue woh wuzu kare."
"349","[AI-translation] Phir Aap ne hukm diya ke jo [namaz mein] hansa ho woh wuzu aur namaz dohraye."
"350","[AI-translation] Jab koi qahqaha lagae to woh wuzu aur namaz dohraye."
"351","[AI-translation] Jab ek aadmi apna tehband takhnon se neeche latkaye namaz padh raha tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Jao aur wuzu karo."
"352","[AI-translation] Wuzu us se hai jo [badan se] nikle, us se nahin jo [andar] dakhil ho."
"353","[AI-translation] Wuzu har behte hue khoon se hai."
"354","[AI-translation] Beshak wuzu ka ek shaitan hai jise Walhan kaha jata hai; to pani ke waswase se bacho."
"355","[AI-translation] Tayammum do zarben hain: chehre ke liye ek zarb aur kuhnion tak dono hathon ke liye ek zarb."
"356","[AI-translation] Sunnat mein se hai ke aadmi ek tayammum se siwae ek namaz ke na padhe, phir doosri namaz ke liye tayammum kare."
"357","[AI-translation] Tayammum karne wala wuzu walon ki imamat na kare."
"358","[AI-translation] Jo halal [tareeqe se hasil] janabat se ghusl kare to Allah use safed moti ke sau mahal dega."
"359","[AI-translation] Dhoop se garam pani se ghusl na karo, kyunke woh bars ka sabab banta hai."
"360","[AI-translation] Jo maiyyat ko ghusl de aur us ke ayb chhupae aur amanat ada kare, to Allah us ke chalis kabeera gunah bakhsh dega."
"361","[AI-translation] Jo janabat ki wajah se baal barabar jagah baghair dhoe chhor de, to us hisse se jahannam mein aisa waisa sulook kiya jaega."
"362","[AI-translation] Har baal ke neeche janabat hai; to balon ko dho aur khal ko saaf karo."
"363","[AI-translation] Woh juma, Eid-ul-Fitr, Eid-ul-Azha aur Arafa ke din ghusl farmate the."
"364","[AI-translation] Woh chaar [wajuhat] se ghusl farmate the: janabat, juma, pichhne lagwana, aur maiyyat ko ghusl dena."
"365","[AI-translation] Har juma ghusl karo agarche tumhen apne din bhar ke khane ke badle pani kharidna pade."
"366","[AI-translation] Jo ghusl ke baad wuzu kare woh ham mein se nahin."
"367","[AI-translation] Haiza aur junubi Quran mein se kuch na padhen."
"368","[AI-translation] Beshak janabat ke siwa koi cheez Aap ko [Quran padhne] se nahin rokti thi."
"369","[AI-translation] Haiz ki kam se kam [muddat] teen [din], ziyada se ziyada das [din] hai."
"370","[AI-translation] Nifas wali ke liye chalis din muqarrar kiye gae siwae is ke ke woh is se pehle paak ho jae."
"371","[AI-translation] Jab moazzin azan shuru kare, Rabb us ke sar par apna hath rakhta hai aur us ke azan se farigh hone tak isi tarah rehta hai."
"372","[AI-translation] Azan siwae ba-wuzu ke na kahe."
"373","[AI-translation] Ladka azan na kahe yahan tak ke baligh ho jae."
"374","[AI-translation] Tumhen azan siwae faseeh ke na kahe."
"375","[AI-translation] Moazzin ke Ashhadu anna Muhammada-ur-Rasoolullah kehne par dono shahadat ki unglion ke andaruni hisse ko choom kar aankhon par pherna; jo aisa kare us ke liye shafa'at halal ho gayi."
"376","[AI-translation] Jis sheher mein azan kasrat se ho us ki sardi kam ho jati hai."
"377","[AI-translation] Aasman walon ka moazzin Jibreel (Alaihissalam) hai aur un ka imam Mikail (Alaihissalam) hai."
"378","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki azan azan aur iqamat mein do do martaba hoti thi."
"379","[AI-translation] Jo azan kahe wohi iqamat kahe."
"380","[AI-translation] Moazzin azan ka ziyada haqdar hai jabke imam iqamat ka ziyada haqdar hai."
"381","[AI-translation] Jo sirf iqamat kahe woh ham mein se nahin."
"382","[AI-translation] Beshak Bilal ne iqamat kehni shuru ki; jab Qad qamat-is-salah tak pahunche, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aqamahallahu wa adamaha [Allah use qayam rakhe aur baqi rakhe]."
"383","[AI-translation] Har do azanon ke darmiyan namaz hai siwae maghrib ke."
"384","[AI-translation] Apni azan aur iqamat ke darmiyan itna fasla rakho jitne mein khane wala apna khana aur peene wala apna peena khatm kar le."
"385","[AI-translation] Jis ke han bachcha paida ho aur woh us ke daen kaan mein azan aur baen kaan mein iqamat kahe to umm-us-sibyan use nuqsan nahin pahunchaegi."
"386","[AI-translation] Jo namaz na padhe us ka Islam mein koi hissa nahin."
"387","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ne logon par un ke deen mein sab se pehle namaz farz ki."
"388","[AI-translation] Teen cheezen: jo un ki hifazat kare woh haqeeqi wali hai; jo unhen zae kare woh haqeeqi dushman hai: namaz, roza, aur janabat."
"389","[AI-translation] Beshak mujhe namaz padhne walon ko qatl karne se mana kiya gaya hai."
"390","[AI-translation] Jis ne isha jamaat se padhi to us ne Lailatul Qadr se apna hissa pa liya."
"391","[AI-translation] Na khane ke liye namaz moakhar karo na kisi aur kaam ke liye."
"392","[AI-translation] Namaz ka awwal waqt Allah ki raza hai jabke aakhir waqt Allah ki maghfirat aur muafi hai."
"393","[AI-translation] Jo fajr ko raushan kare [awal tareeki mein padhe], to Allah us ke dil aur us ki qabr ko raushan karega, aur us ki namaz bhi qubool hogi."
"394","[AI-translation] Fajr ko raushan karo tum bakhsh diye jaoge."
"395","[AI-translation] Woh fajr padhte jab raushni aasman par phail chuki hoti."
"396","[AI-translation] Woh asr moakhar farmate jab tak suraj safed saaf rehta."
"397","[AI-translation] Jo masjid mein duniyawi baat kare to Allah us ke a'mal zae kar deta hai."
"398","[AI-translation] Koi raat nahin siwae is ke ke pukarne wala pukarta hai: Aey qabr walon! Tum kis par rashk karte ho? Woh kehte hain: Masjid walon par."
"399","[AI-translation] Apni masjiden apne chhote bachchon se bachao."
"400","[AI-translation] Masjidon mein baithna meri ummat ki rahbaniyat hai."
"401","[AI-translation] Jo masjid mein chiragh jalae, aam farishte aur Arsh uthane wale farishte us ke liye maghfirat mangte rehte hain jab tak us chiragh ki raushni us masjid mein rahe."
"402","[AI-translation] In masjidon ki dekh bhaal karo safedi se, chiraghon se, qandilon se, aur pakeezah khushbu se."
"403","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din saari zameenen fana ho jaengi siwae masjidon ke; Beshak un mein se baaz baaz se mil jaengi."
"404","[AI-translation] Jo Allah ke gharon mein se kisi ghar mein jhadu de, goya us ne chaar sau hajj kiye."
"405","[AI-translation] Masjidon mein jhadu dena hooron ka mehar hai."
"406","[AI-translation] Mujhe meri ummat ke ajr dikhaye gae yahan tak ke tinka bhi jo aadmi masjid se nikale."
"407","[AI-translation] Jab tum mein se koi masjid mein joon paye to use dafan kar de."
"408","[AI-translation] Agar us ke paas asa na ho to woh lakeer kheench le."
"409","[AI-translation] Koi cheez namaz ko nahin torti; [aage se guzarne wale ko] jahan tak ho sake roko."
"410","[AI-translation] Beshak jo namazi ke aage se jan boojh kar guzre woh qayamat ke din tamanna karega ke kaash woh sookha darakht hota."
"411","[AI-translation] Aap ne ek aadmi ko dekha jo kisi aadmi ki taraf [use sutra bana kar] namaz padh raha tha, to use namaz dohrane ka hukm diya."
"412","[AI-translation] Khabardar! Koi shakhs kisi shakhs ki taraf ya qabr ki taraf [sutra bana kar] namaz na padhe."
"413","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke aakhri namaz jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mere peeche padhi, woh Aap ne ek kapde mein padhi."
"414","[AI-translation] Ek kapde mein namaz padhna sunnat hai."
"415","[AI-translation] Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Aishah ko ek kapde mein namaz padhte dekha; aadha kapda Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par tha aur aadha Aishah par tha."
"416","[AI-translation] Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne shalwar [pehan kar baghair upari libas] namaz padhne se mana farmaya."
"417","[AI-translation] Jab tum namaz padho to apne kapde [takhnon se upar] uthao; tumhare kapdon ka jo hissa zameen ko lagega woh aag mein hai."
"418","[AI-translation] Jab tum namaz ke liye khade ho to apne joote pehno."
"419","[AI-translation] Namaz ke kamal mein se hai ke dono jooton mein namaz padhe."
"420","[AI-translation] Jibreel mere paas aae aur unhon ne bismillah-ir-Rahman-ir-Raheem buland awaz se padhi."
"421","[AI-translation] Woh namaz ke shuru mein dono hath uthate the phir dobara na uthate."
"422","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab ruku mein jate aur ruku se uthte dono hath uthate the. Phir, woh sirf namaz ke shuru mein hath uthate aur is ke siwa tark kar diya."
"423","[AI-translation] Jo namaz mein dono hath uthae us ki namaz nahin."
"424","[AI-translation] Sunnat mein se hai ke namaz mein ek hatheli doosri hatheli par naaf ke neeche rakhe."
"425","[AI-translation] Jis ka imam ho us ke liye imam ki qiraat hi qiraat hai."
"426","[AI-translation] Tumhen imam ki qiraat kafi hai, khwah woh aahista padhe ya buland awaz se."
"427","[AI-translation] Imam ke peeche qiraat nahin."
"428","[AI-translation] Jo imam ke peeche [Quran] padhe us ki namaz nahin."
"429","[AI-translation] Mujhe namaz mein do khamoshiyan yaad hain: ek khamoshi jab imam pehli takbeer kahe yahan tak ke qiraat shuru kare, aur ek khamoshi Surah Fatiha aur surah mukammal karne ke baad ruku se pehle."
"430","[AI-translation] Imam ke liye do khamoshiyan hain; un mein Surah Fatiha ko ghanimat samjho."
"431","[AI-translation] Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ghair-il-maghzubi alaihim wa-laz-zaalleen padha phir aameen kaha aur us mein awaz past ki."
"432","[AI-translation] Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha jab woh sajda farmate donon ghutne hathon se pehle zameen par rakhte the."
"433","[AI-translation] Jab tum mein se koi ruku kare to apne ruku mein teen martaba Subhana Rabbiyal Azeem kahe ... aur jab tum mein se koi sajda kare to apne sajde mein teen martaba Subhana Rabbiyal A'la kahe."
"434","[AI-translation] Peshani par sajda farz hai jabke naak par nafl hai."
"435","[AI-translation] Jab aurat namaz mein baithe to ek raan doosri raan par rakhe; jab sajda kare to pet ko ranon se mila le."
"436","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz mein donon qadmon ke panjon par khade hote the."
"437","[AI-translation] Jo Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par durood na bheje us ki namaz qubool nahin."
"438","[AI-translation] Jab imam namaz mukammal karke baithe phir salam se pehle be-wuzu ho jae, to us ki namaz mukammal hai."
"439","[AI-translation] Jo subah ki namaz ke baad koi baat karne se pehle Qul Huwallahu Ahad sau martaba padhe, to jab bhi woh Qul Huwallahu Ahad padhe us ke saal bhar ke gunah bakhsh diye jaenge."
"440","[AI-translation] Jo baghair uzr do namazen jama kare us ne kabeera gunahon ke darwazon mein se ek darwaza kiya."
"441","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah us ki namaz qubool nahin farmata jo apna tehband takhnon se neeche latkata hai."
"442","[AI-translation] Idhar udhar dekhne wale ki namaz nahin."
"443","[AI-translation] Jo namaz mein khada ho kar idhar udhar dekhe, to Allah us ki namaz radd kar deta hai."
"444","[AI-translation] Namaz mein pehlu par hath rakhna jahannamiyon ka aaram hai."
"445","[AI-translation] Woh namaz mein apni dadhi ko chhute the."
"446","[AI-translation] Aap ne sajde mein phoonk marne se mana farmaya."
"447","[AI-translation] Tum mein se kisi ka [sajde mein] kankariyon se hath rok lena us ke liye sau surkh oontniyon se behtar hai."
"448","[AI-translation] Woh namaz mein apne chehre se paseena ponchte the."
"449","[AI-translation] Namaz mein chheenkna, oonghna aur jamai lena shaitan ki taraf se hai."
"450","[AI-translation] Woh namaz mein jamai ko napasand farmate the."
"451","[AI-translation] Logon ki imamat woh kare jo sab se khoobsurat chehre wala ho."
"452","[AI-translation] Agar tum chahte ho ke tumhari namazen qubool hon, to tumhare behtareen log tumhari imamat karen."
"453","[AI-translation] Jo muttaqi aalim ke peeche namaz padhe, goya us ne Nabi ke peeche namaz padhi."
"454","[AI-translation] Har naik aur badkar ke peeche namaz padho."
"455","[AI-translation] Jo kisi qaum ki imamat kare phir maloom ho ke woh be-wuzu ya junubi tha, to woh apni namaz dohraye aur woh bhi dohrayen."
"456","[AI-translation] Mere baad koi baith kar [imamat ki] namaz na padhae."
"457","[AI-translation] Imam ko darmiyan mein rakho."
"458","[AI-translation] Jo fajr jamaat se padhe, goya us ne Adam (Alaihissalam) ke sath pachaas hajj kiye."
"459","[AI-translation] Jo chalis raaton tak fajr ki ek rak'at bhi na chhore woh marne se pehle jannat mein apna thikana dekh lega."
"460","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) duniya se rukhsat hone tak fajr ki namaz mein qunoot padhte rahe."
"461","[AI-translation] Beshak momin jab farz namaz jamaat se padhta hai to us se gunah is tarah jhad jate hain jaise yeh patte jhadte hain."
"462","[AI-translation] Do aur is se ziyada jamaat hai."
"463","[AI-translation] Jab jamaat khadi ho jae to farz ke siwa koi namaz nahin siwae fajr ki do sunnat ke."
"464","[AI-translation] Apne imam se ruku mein sabqat na karo, kyunke tum use pa loge jo tum se aage nikal gaya."
"465","[AI-translation] Farz namaz ka waqt aa gaya jabke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath apni sawariyon par the; to Aap hamare aage badhe aur hamari imamat ki aur ham ne apni sawariyon par namaz padhi."
"466","[AI-translation] Aey Ali! Namaz mein imam ko luqma na do."
"467","[AI-translation] Aurat akele ek saf hai."
"468","[AI-translation] Woh fajr ki do sunnaten safar mein na hazar mein tark farmate the."
"469","[AI-translation] Jo zuhr se pehle chaar rak'aten padhe us ke us din ke gunah bakhsh diye jaenge."
"470","[AI-translation] Jo zuhr se pehle chaar rak'aton par hamesha na kare use meri shafa'at naseeb na hogi."
"471","[AI-translation] Jo asr se pehle chaar rak'aten padhe to Allah us ke badan ko aag par haraam kar dega."
"472","[AI-translation] Jo maghrib ke baad chhe rak'aten padhe aur un ke darmiyan koi buri baat na kahe, to yeh us ke liye barah saal ki ibadat ke barabar hongi."
"473","[AI-translation] Jo maghrib aur isha ke darmiyan bees rak'aten padhe, to Allah us ke liye jannat mein ghar banaega."
"474","[AI-translation] Woh (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) maghrib ke baad do rak'aten padhte aur un mein itni lambi qiraat farmate ke masjid wale muntashir ho jate."
"475","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas meri hazri ke do waqt the: ek raat mein aur ek din mein; jab main raat mein aata [aur woh namaz mein hote] to woh mujhe ittila ke liye khankharte."
"476","[AI-translation] Momin ki izzat us ke raat mein qiyam [karne] mein hai."
"477","[AI-translation] Aadhi raat mein do rak'aten gunahon ko mita deti hain."
"478","[AI-translation] Do rak'aten jo Adam ka beta raat ke aakhri hisse mein padhta hai us ke liye duniya aur jo us mein hai se behtar hain, aur agar meri ummat par mashaqqat ka khauf na hota to main un par farz kar deta."
"479","[AI-translation] Raat ki namaz kabhi na chhoro agarche bakri dohne ke waqfe mein."
"480","[AI-translation] Aey Quran walon! Quran ko takiya na banao, aur use din aur raat ke auqat mein padho jaisa padhne ka haq hai."
"481","[AI-translation] Jis ki raat mein namazen ziyada hon us ka chehra din mein [utna hi] khoobsurat hota hai."
"482","[AI-translation] Jab tum mein se koi is niyyat se soe ke raat mein [qiyam] padhega to apne pehlu mein mitti ki ek mutthi rakh le."
"483","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ne tumhari namazon par ek namaz ka izafa kiya hai, aur woh witr hai."
"484","[AI-translation] Jo witr na padhe woh ham mein se nahin."
"485","[AI-translation] Jo witr na padhe us ki namaz nahin."
"486","[AI-translation] Witr Quran walon par hai."
"487","[AI-translation] Witr har Musalman par wajib hai."
"488","[AI-translation] Witr teen rak'aten maghrib ki tarah hai."
"489","[AI-translation] Jis ki raat mein witr reh jae woh subah us ki qaza kare."
"490","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ramazan mein bees rak'aten [tarawih] padhte the."
"491","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar ke zamane mein log Ramazan mein taees rak'aten [tarawih] padhte the."
"492","[AI-translation] Unhon ne ek aadmi ko hukm diya ke logon ki imamat kare ... bees rak'aten."
"493","[AI-translation] Mere walid Ramazan mein Madinah mein logon ki bees rak'aten [tarawih] padhate the."
"494","[AI-translation] Beshak jannat mein ek darwaza hai jise Zuha kaha jata hai; jo chasht ki namaz padhe to qayamat ke din yeh namaz us ki taraf is tarah maael hogi jaise bachcha apni maan ki taraf maael hota hai, yahan tak ke woh us ka isteqbal karegi, aur namazi jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"495","[AI-translation] Beshak jannat mein ek darwaza hai jise Zuha kaha jata hai; us se sirf woh dakhil hoga jo chasht ki namaz par hamesha karta tha."
"496","[AI-translation] Jo chasht ki namaz par hamesha kare aur baghair uzr use na chhore, to main aur woh jannat mein noor ki kashti mein noor ke samandar mein honge yahan tak ke ham Rabb-ul-Aalameen ki ziyarat karenge."
"497","[AI-translation] Munafiq chasht ki namaz nahin padhta."
"498","[AI-translation] Chasht ki do rak'aten un ki [hum-naam] do suraton ke sath padho: Wash-shamsi wa zuhaha aur Waz-zuha."
"499","[AI-translation] Jo chasht ki do rak'aten padhe to Allah us ke liye das lakh nekiyan likh dega."
"500","[AI-translation] Woh chasht safar mein na ghair mein tark farmate the."
"501","[AI-translation] Woh chasht is kadar padhte ke ham kehte ab nahin chhorenge, aur chhorte is kadar ke ham kehte ab nahin padhenge."
"502","[AI-translation] Jis ki Allah se ya Bani Adam mein se kisi se hajat ho, woh wuzu kare aur achchi tarah wuzu kare, phir do rak'aten padhe, phir Allah ki sana kare, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par durood bheje, phir yeh dua padhe La ilaha illallah-ul-Haleem ... siwae is ke ke use poori farma, aey sab se ziyada rehem farmane wale."
"503","[AI-translation] Ya Rasulullah! Gunahgar apne gunahon se tauba kaise kare? Aap ne farmaya: Woh peer ki raat witr ke baad ghusl kare aur barah rak'aten padhe."
"504","[AI-translation] Jo Ashura ki raat [nafl ibadat se] zinda rakhe, goya us ne aasman walon ki ibadat ki tarah Allah ki ibadat ki."
"505","[AI-translation] Jo Rajab ke pehle jumeraat ko roza rakhe, phir juma ki raat barah rak'aten padhe... [salat-ur-raghaib ke bare mein taweel hadees]."
"506","[AI-translation] Jo Rajab ki pehli raat maghrib padhe phir us ke baad bees rak'aten padhe."
"507","[AI-translation] Jo Rajab ki pandrahwin raat chaudah rak'aten padhe ... to Allah us ki taraf ek hazar farishte bhejega."
"508","[AI-translation] Jo Shaban ki pandrahwin raat sau rak'aten padhe ... to Allah us ki har hajat poori farmadega."
"509","[AI-translation] Jo juma ki raat do rak'aten padhe har rak'at mein Surah Fatiha aur Surah Zilzal pandrah martaba padhe, to Allah use qabr ke azab aur qayamat ke haul se aman dega."
"510","[AI-translation] Jo juma ke din zuhr aur asr ke darmiyan do rak'aten padhe ... to woh duniya se na jaega yahan tak ke apne Rabb ko khwab mein dekhe aur jannat mein apna thikana dekhe."
"511","[AI-translation] Jo hafta ke din chasht ke waqt chaar rak'aten padhe ... to un ke liye mubarak ho."
"512","[AI-translation] Jo itwar ki raat chaar rak'aten padhe ...."
"513","[AI-translation] Jo peer ke din chaar rak'aten padhe ... to Allah use jannat mein mahal dega."
"514","[AI-translation] Afzal tareen din juma ka din hai."
"515","[AI-translation] Juma miskeenon ka hajj hai."
"516","[AI-translation] Jab juma mehfooz ho jae to sab din mehfooz ho jaenge."
"517","[AI-translation] Ramazan mein juma ki baqi jumon par fazeelat aisi hai jaise Ramazan ki baqi mahinon par fazeelat hai."
"518","[AI-translation] Jis ki juma ki namaz chhoot jae woh ek dinar sadqa kare."
"519","[AI-translation] Juma ke din ghusl karna sunnat hai."
"520","[AI-translation] Juma ke din ghusl karo agarche tumhen ek pyala pani ek dinar mein kharidna pade."
"521","[AI-translation] Jo har juma apne nakhun kate aur moonchhen le, to Allah un mein shifa dakhil karega aur un se beemari nikal dega."
"522","[AI-translation] Juma ke din momin ki misaal ehram wale ki tarah hai: woh apne baal na kate na nakhun yahan tak ke namaz mukammal kare."
"523","[AI-translation] Amame ke sath juma baghair amame ke sattar [jumon] se afzal hai."
"524","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ke kuch farishte hain jo juma ke din safed amame walon ke liye maghfirat mangte hain."
"525","[AI-translation] Juma us par hai jo raat apne ghar walon ke sath guzare."
"526","[AI-translation] Juma us par hai jo awaz [ki had] mein ho."
"527","[AI-translation] Sunnat jari ho chuki ke har chalis aur is se ziyada [par] juma hai."
"528","[AI-translation] Jab ham mein se sattar mard juma ko jaen, to woh Musa ke un sattar [afraad] ki tarah hain jo wafd ban kar apne Rabb ke paas gae, ya un se bhi afzal."
"529","[AI-translation] Juma aur tashreeq sirf bare sheher [ki jama masjid] mein hai."
"530","[AI-translation] Agar mimbar na hote to bastiyon wale jal jaate."
"531","[AI-translation] Jab woh mimbar par chadhte to salam farmate."
"532","[AI-translation] Jab khateeb mimbar par chadh jae to na namaz hai na baat."
"533","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) juma se pehle chaar rak'aten padhte aur un mein se kisi mein fasl na farmate."
"534","[AI-translation] Jo juma ke din baat kare jabke imam khutba de raha ho, to woh kitaben uthae gadhe ki tarah hai; aur jo us se kahe khamosh raho, to us ka juma nahin."
"535","[AI-translation] Jo imam ke aane ke baad logon ki gardanen phalange aur do ke darmiyan judai dale woh aisa hai jaise aag mein apni anten ghaseet raha ho."
"536","[AI-translation] Juma ke din nekiyan dogni kar di jati hain."
"537","[AI-translation] Jo juma ke din fajr se pehle Astaghfirullah-allazi la ilaha illa Huwal-Hayy-ul-Qayyum wa atoobu ilaih teen martaba kahe, to us ke gunah bakhsh diye jaenge agarche samandar ki jhaag ke barabar hon."
"538","[AI-translation] Jo juma ki raat Ha Meem Dukhan padhe woh bakhsh diya jaega."
"539","[AI-translation] Jo juma ki raat ya juma ke din Ha Meem Dukhan padhe, to Allah us ke liye jannat mein ghar banaega."
"540","[AI-translation] Jo Eid-ul-Fitr aur Eid-ul-Azha ki raaten sawab ki niyyat se [ibadat mein] guzare, us ka dil us din na marega jis din [sab] dil mar jaenge."
"541","[AI-translation] Jo Eid-ul-Fitr ki raat sau rak'aten padhe ...."
"542","[AI-translation] Ham [Eid-ul-Fitr ke din] khate, peete aur ghusl karte, phir Eidgah ki taraf nikalte."
"543","[AI-translation] Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) donon Eidon aur juma mein surkh chadren pehente the."
"544","[AI-translation] Apni Eidon ko takbeerat se muzayyan karo."
"545","[AI-translation] Donon Eidon ko tahleel, taqdees, tahmeed aur takbeer se muzayyan karo."
"546","[AI-translation] Beshak woh takbeerat itni buland kehte ke raste wale sun lete."
"547","[AI-translation] Woh donon Eidon mein chaar takbeerat kehte janaze ki takbeeron ki tarah."
"548","[AI-translation] Unhon ne Eid do rak'aten padhai; un mein siwae Umm-ul-Kitab ke kuch na padha."
"549","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) donon Eidon ki namaz mein Amma Yatasaaloon aur Wash-shamsi wa Zuhaha padhte the."
"550","[AI-translation] Aap ne donon Eidon mein Islami mulk mein hathyar pehenne se mana farmaya siwae is ke ke dushman samne ho."
"551","[AI-translation] Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko donon Eidon ke din dekha aur Aap ke samne neza tha."
"552","[AI-translation] Beshak un par Eid ke din barish hui, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen masjid mein Eid ki namaz padhai."
"553","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ke behtareen woh hain jo ... jab safar karen to qasr karen."
"554","[AI-translation] Aey Makkah walon! Chaar bareed se kam mein qasr na karo, [jaise] Makkah se Usfan tak."
"555","[AI-translation] Woh safar mein qasr farmate aur poori bhi padhte."
"556","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Ramazan mein umre par nikli ... Aap ne qasr ki aur main ne poori padhi; phir main ne kaha ... Aap ne qasr ki aur main ne poori padhi. Aap ne farmaya: Aey Aishah! Tum ne bhi achcha kiya!"
"557","[AI-translation] Safar mein poori namaz padhne wala hazar mein qasr karne wale ki tarah hai."
"558","[AI-translation] Jo safar mein chaar rak'aten padhe woh hazar mein do rak'aten padhne wale ki tarah hai."
"559","[AI-translation] Jo safar mein chaar rak'aten padhe woh namaz dohraye."
"560","[AI-translation] Hajj ya jihad ke siwa mein qasr na karo."
"561","[AI-translation] Jo namaz bhool jae us ka waqt hai jab use yaad aae."
"562","[AI-translation] Aap se us aadmi ke bare mein poocha gaya jo namaz mein bhool jae aur na jane kitni padhi; Aap ne farmaya: Woh apni namaz dohraye aur baith kar do sajde kare."
"563","[AI-translation] Salat-ul-khauf mein sahw nahin."
"564","[AI-translation] Imam ke peeche muqtadi par sahw [ke sajde] nahin; agar imam bhool jae to us par aur us ke peeche walon par sahw hai."
"565","[AI-translation] Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein apne dono joote utare to unhen apne samne na rakhe ke woh un ki pairwi kare, aur na apne peeche rakhe ke us ka Musalman bhai un ki pairwi kare; balke unhen apne donon qadmon ke darmiyan rakhe."
"566","[AI-translation] [Namaz-e-kusuf ki] har rak'at mein ek ruku hai."
"567","[AI-translation] Kya Surah Hajj ko fazeelat di gayi kyunke us mein do sajde hain? Aap ne farmaya: Han; aur jo donon sajde na kare woh unhen na padhe."
"568","[AI-translation] Qaidi ki namaz do rak'aten hain yahan tak ke woh mar jae ya Allah us ki qaid khatm kar de."
"569","[AI-translation] Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use hukm diya ke kashti mein khade ho kar namaz padhe siwae is ke ke doobne ka khauf ho."
"570","[AI-translation] Teen afraad ki namaz Allah qubool nahin farmata aur na un ki koi neki aasman ki taraf uthti hai: bhaga hua ghulam yahan tak ke apne aaqaon ke paas wapas aae, woh aurat jis se us ka shohar naraz ho yahan tak ke woh razi ho jae, aur nashay wala yahan tak ke hosh mein aae."
"571","[AI-translation] Jo yateem ka sarparast bane woh us ke maal se tijarat kare aur use na chhore ke zakat use kha jae."
"572","[AI-translation] Main ne poocha ya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se zakat ke bare mein poocha gaya, to Aap ne farmaya: Beshak maal mein zakat ke siwa bhi [ek] haq hai; phir Aap ne Surah Baqarah ki yeh aayat tilawat ki: Neki yeh nahin ke tum apne chehre mashriq ya maghrib ki taraf phero."
"573","[AI-translation] Charne wale ghodon mein har ghode par ek dinar hai."
"574","[AI-translation] Beshak auqas [do nisab ke darmiyani miqdar] mein koi farz nahin."
"575","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen hukm farmate the ke jo maal ham bechne ke liye tayyar karen us se sadqa [zakat] nikalen."
"576","[AI-translation] Aur kheera, tarbooz, anaar, ganna aur sabziyon mein, to muaf hai; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use muaf farmaya."
"577","[AI-translation] Sabziyon mein sadqa [zakat] nahin."
"578","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke angoor ka andaza is tarah lagaya jae jaise khajoor ka andaza lagaya jata hai, aur us ki zakat kishmish ki surat mein li jae jaise khajoor ka sadqa chhuhare ki surat mein liya jata hai."
"579","[AI-translation] Zewar mein zakat nahin."
"580","[AI-translation] Jab tum [fasaal ka] andaza lagao to lo aur teesra hissa chhor do; agar teesra hissa na chhor sako to chautha hissa chhor do."
"581","[AI-translation] Shehed mein zakat nahin."
"582","[AI-translation] Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hazrat Bilal bin Haris Muzani (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Qabliya ki kaanen ata farmain; yeh Fara ke ek taraf hai; to in kaanon se aaj tak zakat ke siwa kuch nahin liya gaya."
"583","[AI-translation] Sadqa [haraam maal/ roki hui zakat] kabhi kisi maal se nahin milta siwae is ke ke use halak kar deta hai."
"584","[AI-translation] Zakat ada karo aur use ilm walon mein talash karo, kyunke woh behtar aur muttaqi hai."
"585","[AI-translation] Anqareeb tumhare paas [zakat lene wale] sawar aaenge jinhen tum napasand karoge; jab woh tumhare paas aaen to un ka isteqbal karo, unhen aur jo woh chahen lene do; agar woh adl karen to sawab, aur agar zulm karen to gunah un par; lekin unhen razi rakho, kyunke tumhari zakat ka kamal un ki raza mein hai, aur woh tumhare liye dua karen."
"586","[AI-translation] Dana dane se, bakri bakriyon se, oont oonton se, aur gae gaon se lo."
"587","[AI-translation] Ham ne kaha: Beshak sadqa lene wale ham par ziyadati karte hain; kya ham apne malon mein se utna chhupa len jitni woh ziyadati karte hain? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin."
"588","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah sadqe ke bare mein kisi Nabi ya kisi ke hukm par razi na hua yahan tak ke Khud us mein hukm diya; phir use aath hisson mein taqseem kiya."
"589","[AI-translation] Sadqa-e-fitr do afraad ki taraf se gehon ka ek sa' hai."
"590","[AI-translation] Is [Eid ke] din unhen dar dar phirne se be-niyaaz kar do."
"591","[AI-translation] Afzal tareen sadqa yeh hai ke Musalman aadmi ilm seekhe phir apne Musalman bhai ko sikhaye."
"592","[AI-translation] Kya main tumhen afzal tareen sadqe ke bare mein na bataun? Tumhari beti jo tumhari taraf laut aai ho, us ke liye tumhare siwa koi kamane wala na ho."
"593","[AI-translation] Kaunsa sadqa afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ramazan mein sadqa."
"594","[AI-translation] Sadqa dene mein jaldi karo, kyunke balaa us se aage nahin badhti."
"595","[AI-translation] Thoda sadqa badi balaa ko rok deta hai."
"596","[AI-translation] Sakhi Allah ki rehmat se qareeb hai, jannat se qareeb hai, logon se qareeb hai, aur jahannam ki aag se door hai; jabke bakheel Allah se door hai, jannat se door hai, logon se door hai, aur jahannam ke qareeb hai. Aur jahil sakhi Allah ko bakheel aabid se ziyada mahboob hai."
"597","[AI-translation] Jannat sakhiyon ka ghar hai."
"598","[AI-translation] Dhokebaaz, bakheel aur ehsan jatane wala jannat mein dakhil na hoga."
"599","[AI-translation] Beshak sadqa buri maut se bachata hai."
"600","[AI-translation] Faqeer ameeron ke rumal hain; woh un se apne gunah ponchte hain."
"601","[AI-translation] Jis ka uzr zahir ho jae to us par sadqa wajib ho gaya."
"602","[AI-translation] Mangne wale ko do agarche woh ghode par aae."
"603","[AI-translation] Agar tumhen mangna hi ho, to nek logon se mango."
"604","[AI-translation] Allah ki Zaat ke waseele se sirf jannat mangi jae."
"605","[AI-translation] Jab yateem rota hai to us ke aansoo Rahman ki hatheli par girte hain."
"606","[AI-translation] Jo aisi jagah pani pilae jahan pani par us ka ikhtiyar ho, to use har ghoont par das nekiyan milengi, khwah woh naik ho ya badkar."
"607","[AI-translation] Logon se narmi sadqa hai."
"608","[AI-translation] Jis ke paas sadqa na ho woh Yahud par la'nat kare."
